"""ImageToolbox fast-noise texture presets (122 procedural textures).

ImageToolbox renders these with ImageToolboxLibs' native ``fast-noise`` library
(``textures/ProceduralTextures.cpp`` on FastNoiseLite; Apache-2.0 / MIT).  The
per-pixel kernels are ported to numba in :mod:`._procedural_basic` (types 0-50),
:mod:`._procedural_showcase` (51-70) and :mod:`._procedural_sim` (71-121);
FastNoiseLite itself lives in :mod:`.fastnoise_lite`.

Parameters mirror ImageToolbox's ``FastNoiseParams`` UI (titles, slider ranges)
and ``FastNoiseTextureParams.defaultFor`` (defaults, colours).  The noise seed is
``1337 + seed`` (ImageToolbox's default seed is 1337), so ``seed=0`` reproduces
ImageToolbox's default output.  This table was generated from the upstream
sources; the order of values/colours is the order the native code receives them.
"""
